DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44292::$$$message_0380_0000_0000$$$::"Hah, haah, haaah... We won, but... Taiga, that was..."::
44293::$$$message_0380_0000_0001$$$::"Heh. A ruthless coup de grace... You've grown strong, Illya..."[nolr][p]::
44294::$$$message_0380_0000_0002$$$::"I knew it...! Hang in there, Taiga! Why did you hold back!?"::
44295::$$$message_0380_0001_0000$$$::"The Taiga I know would never die!"::
44296::$$$message_0380_0001_0001$$$::"I mean, seriously, you never die no matter what happens! I bet you'd give cockroaches a run for their money in sheer survival ability, so why...!?"::
44297::$$$message_0380_0001_0002$$$::"Oof, that cuts me deep...[l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=まったく2 layer=0 time=200][say storage=HSTRE2_TIG_0030 _name=藤ねえ] But it's okay, Illya. You fought well."::
44298::$$$message_0380_0001_0003$$$::"You don't need my help anymore."::
44299::$$$message_0380_0001_0004$$$::"Servants disappear when the Holy Grail War ends. So before the end, as your master, I just wanted to be the bedrock for...your growth..."::
44300::$$$message_0380_0001_0005$$$::"No...! [l][hfwww layer=1][say storage=HSTRE2_BIR_0060 _name=ブルマイリヤ]It's all wrong, Taiga! You aren't supposed to be this cool of a character!"::
44301::$$$message_0380_0001_0006$$$::"Also, [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTRE2_BIR_0090 _name=ブルマイリヤ]I don't understand![lr]::
44302::$$$message_0380_0001_0007$$$::[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=哀2 layer=1 time=200]Are you telling me that you turned into experience points for me to level up?"::
44303::$$$message_0380_0001_0008$$$::"...Heh. That's the dead simple truth. Hehe..."::
44304::$$$message_0380_0001_0009$$$::"But it's okay, Illya.[lr]::
44305::$$$message_0380_0001_0010$$$::Let's just say you can be my dream now..."::
44306::$$$message_0380_0001_0011$$$::"That sounds like it would be a huge pain in the butt. [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTRE2_BIR_0140 _name=ブルマイリヤ]I don't want this at all![lr]::
44307::$$$message_0380_0001_0012$$$::[hfwww layer=1]And I have no idea what you're talking about!"::
44308::$$$message_0380_0001_0013$$$::"Hurgh...[l][hffeelblue layer=0][say storage=HSTRE2_TIG_0110 _name=藤ねえ]blargh."::
44309::$$$message_0380_0001_0014$$$::"TAIGAAAAAA!"[rf][nolr][p]::
44310::$$$message_0380_0001_0015$$$::"The stars are moving on their own... Is that the Holy Grail...?"[nolr][p]::
44311::$$$message_0380_0001_0016$$$::"You've done well to arrive here, traveler from another world. In the name of celestial motion, I shall grant you one wish."::
44312::$$$message_0380_0001_0017$$$::"A wish...? My wish?"::
44313::$$$message_0380_0001_0018$$$::"Right! Make the whole world into a gym...!"[wait canskip=0 time=800]::
44314::$$$message_0380_0001_0019$$$::"...No, I don't care about that anymore. If you're a god, then bring Taiga back to life."[wm canskip=0]::
44315::$$$message_0380_0001_0020$$$::"...Oh? [l][hfwww layer=0][say storage=HSTRE2_HSI_0030 _name=星神]You could ask me to make you the heroine of your own storyline, you know."::
44316::$$$message_0380_0001_0021$$$::"Sadly, that won't happen... And if it was going to be all official, then that wish would belong to the Illya of this world."::
44317::$$$message_0380_0001_0022$$$::"I'm the Master of this strange Servant. I have to look after her."::
44318::$$$message_0380_0001_0023$$$::"...Are you sure?"::
44319::$$$message_0380_0002_0000$$$::"At this rate, both of you will take on peculiar character traits..."::
44320::$$$message_0380_0003_0000$$$::"And you'll be destined to play nothing but peculiar roles in peculiar worlds."::
44321::$$$message_0380_0003_0001$$$::"I'll be blunt. A harsh fate lies in store for you."::
44322::$$$message_0380_0003_0002$$$::"...Yeah. I think I know what you mean."::
44323::$$$message_0380_0003_0003$$$::"Taiga and I are going to learn about a lot of events, and we won't get to interact with any normal timelines' stories because we know them all."::
44324::$$$message_0380_0003_0004$$$::"Um, it's like we'll be ghosts haunting a bunch of different worlds, right?"::
44325::$$$message_0380_0003_0005$$$::"Correct. Scene shifters, if you will."::
44326::$$$message_0380_0003_0006$$$::"Yeah. But that also means anything could happen. While we won't have a home to go back to, we can go anywhere."::
44327::$$$message_0380_0003_0007$$$::"It would be lonely all by myself, but I won't be bored with that loud idiot around. It's actually a happy ending, if you think about it."::
44328::$$$message_0380_0003_0008$$$::"I see... Then I will question you no further.[lr]::
44329::$$$message_0380_0003_0009$$$::[hfwww layer=0][nolr]Return to life, Servant. Use your power to spread chaos through the world!"[p]::
44330::$$$message_0380_0003_0010$$$::"Farewell. If we are still fated to meet again, let it be in a hundred years!"[nolr][p]::
44331::$$$message_0380_0003_0011$$$::"Mm..."::
44332::$$$message_0380_0003_0012$$$::"Taiga! [hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=感動 layer=1 left=7 top=397 time=200][l][say storage=HSTRE2_BIR_0320 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Thank goodness, you woke up!"::
44333::$$$message_0380_0004_0000$$$::"Guagh! Is this some next-generation natural disaster!?"::
44334::$$$message_0380_0005_0000$$$::"[hfwww layer=0]The first thing I see when I wake up is Gym Shorts elbowing me in the stomach!"::
44335::$$$message_0380_0005_0001$$$::"Oh, sorry. I tripped and my elbow just ended up there."::
44336::$$$message_0380_0006_0000$$$::"...You did that on purpose. [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTRE2_TIG_0190 _name=藤ねえ]Totally."::
44337::$$$message_0380_0006_0001$$$::"Yeah. It's a little punishment for a Servant who went AWOL."::
44338::$$$message_0380_0006_0002$$$::"I have a lot of words for you, but that makes us even, my meat cushion."::
44339::$$$message_0380_0006_0003$$$::"Hmm. This feels familiar.[lr]::
44340::$$$message_0380_0006_0004$$$::But I'm happy, so I won't use the Bear Claw on you."::
44341::$$$message_0380_0006_0005$$$::"Then I'll treat you like a bed pillow and look up at the stars while hugging you."::
44342::$$$message_0380_0007_0000$$$::"Yeah. The sky's so big.[lr]::
44343::$$$message_0380_0007_0001$$$::When I lie down and stare up at it, it feels like it's going to swallow me up."[nolr][p]::
44344::$$$message_0380_0007_0002$$$::"You mean you're scared of it, Illya?"[nolr][p]::
44345::$$$message_0380_0007_0003$$$::"On the contrary.[lr]::
44346::$$$message_0380_0007_0004$$$::I'm not holding any stars anymore, but I can see that there are still plenty more out there."[nolr][p]::
44347::$$$message_0380_0007_0005$$$::"As long as the sky is still there, I don't think our Holy Grail War will be ending anytime soon."[nolr][p]::
44348::$$$message_0380_0007_0006$$$::"...Yeah? So where are we off to next?[lr]::
44349::$$$message_0380_0007_0007$$$::If the war's still going, then I have to protect you."[nolr][p]::
44350::$$$message_0380_0007_0008$$$::"I'm your Servant and your master, so I'll stick with you until you're tired of it all."[nolr][p]::
44351::$$$message_0380_0007_0009$$$::"Thanks, Taiga.[lr]::
44352::$$$message_0380_0007_0010$$$::Then let's head to the Atlantic. We'll look for the first star which flew off in that direction."::
44353::$$$message_0380_0008_0000$$$::"But we can start tomorrow.[lr]::
44354::$$$message_0380_0008_0001$$$::Tonight, I just want to watch the stars."[nolr][p]::
44355::$$$message_0380_0008_0002$$$::"Sure thing. So, the Atlantic Ocean, eh? Going from a fight in one city to a globetrotting adventure is a heck of a step up."::
44356::$$$message_0380_0008_0003$$$::"Oh, getting cold feet?"::
44357::$$$message_0380_0008_0004$$$::"Wahahaha! I'm getting chills all right, from sheer excitement! All right, let's go conquer the world!"::
44358::$$$message_0380_0008_0005$$$::"That's the spirit, Taiga![lr]::
44359::$$$message_0380_0008_0006$$$::[hfwww layer=1]Our battle's just begun!"::
44360::$$$message_0380_0009_0000$$$::And that's how our Holy Grail War ended, for now.::
44361::$$$message_0380_0010_0000$$$::Taiga and I set off on a merry tour of the world with no destination.::
44362::$$$message_0380_0010_0001$$$::But even that will end eventually.[lr]::
44363::$$$message_0380_0010_0002$$$::It might be an aimless journey, but I'm sure we'll find a place to call home, someday.::
44364::$$$message_0380_0011_0000$$$::We can only shine behind the scenes, but that's an opportunity all its own. We'll help those who fall off the stage get back on their feet.::
44365::$$$message_0380_0011_0001$$$::This tale is over for now.::
44366::$$$message_0380_0012_0000$$$::The story of how they would open a strange dojo in a strange place comes just an itty bitty while later.[nolr][whitestar][p]::

